cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "ExoMamba: Selective State-Space Models for TESS Exoplanet Vetting"
abstract: >-
  Research code for a controlled feasibility study of selective state-space
  models (Mamba) applied to confirmed-planet versus false-positive vetting of
  TESS Objects of Interest from complete global light curves (L = 18,000).
  Includes the data pipeline, model implementations, baselines, the sealed
  TIC-level split files, stored per-sample test predictions, and the inference
  statistics script that reproduces every confidence interval and DeLong test
  reported in the accompanying paper.
type: software
